## Secrets and local-only configuration.
## Real values live in user-secrets (dotnet user-secrets) or in the
## ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection / BDIMS__Admin__* environment
## variables. Never commit them here.
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
.env
.env.*
secrets.json

## Runtime data written by the application. Certificate layouts are
## persisted to App_Data/certificate_templates.json at runtime; that file
## holds administrator-authored content and manual edits, so it is not
## source. A seed copy ships as App_Data/certificate_templates.seed.json.
##
## The leading ** is required: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to the
## repository root, so "App_Data/*.json" never matched "BDIMS/App_Data/..." and
## the runtime file was committed despite the rule.
**/App_Data/*.json
!**/App_Data/*.seed.json
**/App_Data/*.tmp
**/App_Data/*.corrupt-*
**/App_Data/*.bak

## Uploaded profile photos (App_Data/profile_photos). Written at runtime by
## AccountController.ChangePhoto and read back through the authorised
## /Account/ProfilePhoto route, never committed: these are staff photographs and the
## directory is expected to be empty in a fresh checkout.
**/App_Data/profile_photos/

